<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-2485144c-90bd-4037-be14-835f5235d1c5">Free Dinosaur Board Game For Kids Online</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="block-ec5df02a-d3ef-4a3a-9ac9-27d331335e19">Children can play this simple dinosaur board game by clicking in the window below.</p>



<iframe src="https://plays.org/game/dinosaur-board-game/" id="gameembed" class="iframegamewide" frameborder="0"></iframe>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="block-843b8796-ecf7-41fa-b8cc-787c9f8576f2">Alternatively kids can play this dinosaur game for free as a web application <a href="https://plays.org/game/dinosaur-board-game/">here</a>.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-f58ec2a7-d9cc-441b-9428-1fb28f4d3ca9">Dinosaur Dice Board Game for Kids Game Play Instructions</h2>



<div class="row plays-info-area"><div class="pad-20"><div class="row"><div class="two columns"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://plays.org/images/question-icon.png?x21304" class="htp-img"></div><div class="ten columns"><h3 class="wtext">How to Play</h3><p class="wtext mar-b10">Decide who will go first. Roll the dice. Take turns until one player reaches the finish line and wins the game.  </p></div></div></div></div>



<ul class="wp-block-list" id="block-394f6f8c-c0ef-4356-96ae-92fe41eb6a80"><li><strong>Starting the Game</strong><ul><li>Click on the orange button to advance to the rules screen.</li><li>The rules screen explains how to play. The game is similar to Snakes and Ladders whereby a player can get lucky and advance, or be unlucky and get sent back.  </li><li>Click or tap the brown button to start. The main game screen will appear.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Game Controls</strong><ul><li>Red player starts. Click or tap the start button that appears below the dice on the left. </li></ul><ul><li>The dice will be rolled. The piece is advanced forward the number of squares shown on the dice. </li></ul><ul><li>Green player goes second. Click the Play button beneath the dice on the right. The piece is advanced forward the number of squares shown on the dice.</li><li>First player to the finish line wins.  If you&#8217;re unlucky, you may occasionally get sent back. If you&#8217;re lucky, you may jump forward. </li><li>Sound can be toggled on and off by clicking the loud speaker icon. </li></ul></li><li><strong>Target Audience</strong><ul><li>This game is very simple and suited to young children.  </li><li>The game will likely be a bit boring and simplistic for older children.</li><li>This game features colorful dinosaurs and contains no adult imagery. </li></ul></li></ul>



